				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					7.40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> intr., <i>to
				be like, resemble</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν σύνεσιν αὐτοῦ π. ἀνθρώπῳ, τὴν
