				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					9.131
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>represent in art</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				12.77
			</span></i>.</div>
